            "review_title": "Review at 26 - Beer Food Fun",
            "review_text": "Helmut1954\nStuttgart, Germany72 contributions\n0\nOnly a few kind of beears are available\nMay 2018 • Solo\nI was there today at 3pm. I was the only guest. Staff does not speak English. I ordered dark beer locally brewed: not available, a German Hacker Pschorr; not available, A Schorsch Weizen, not available. The special beer for 30k was available. There is no information about the quantity you get. The special beer was 0,3l and it was so la la.\nI the decided not to eat. I don't want to hear again not available.\nThe seats are very uncomfortable\nRead more\nValue\nService\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 13, 2018",
            "rating": 4.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
