            "review_text": "kcinsz\nShenzhen29 contributions\n0\nAwful beer\nOct 2017 • Solo\nThe Pilsner has no flavour, little better than watered-down lager. \nThe Porter is very bitter, more like a stout (there is a difference they don't seem to think beer experts know).\nThe Special Ginger and Ginseng was unavailable so couldn't comment on that.\nAnd they only advertise prices net of VAT. \nExpect a nasty surprise when you ask for the bill.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 22, 2017",
