            "review_text": "Ruben M\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam25 contributions\n0\nTerrible experience\nJun 2017 • Friends\nDon't let yourself be fooled by the modern and cool appearance!! It's not what it looks!\n\nDisguised as a brewpub, there is this mix of beer club and mall that falls short in all aspects.\n\nYou will be welcomed in the ground floor by horrible music and a brewhouse that doesn't seem to have ever been out to any use.\n\nOnce you go to the rooftop where music is more passable, you will be guided into ordering terribly overpriced BBQ food and try the local brews. The beer at least is not overpriced, but you get what you pay for. \n\nThe food is laughable in quality, size, presentation and price but by the time the server brings it you won't be feeling like laughing too much. Service is a nightmare: nothing is ever brought on time, to the right table or the right order. Even if your English speaking waiter gets the order right and get reminded every 10 minutes!\n\nOnly losing my credit card at the end of the short journey could put the cherry on top of the cake. \n\nI can't wait to go back for more :(\nRead more\nWritten June 29, 2017",
